Let’s build this from zero → production-level understanding in a very simple way.

🧠 Goal
You want this:

# values.yaml
apiServer:
  extraVolumes:
    - name: airflow-dags
      hostPath:
        path: /opt/airflow/dags
👉 To automatically appear inside Kubernetes Deployment YAML

